sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Tech as Field technician
  participant App as Mobile app
  participant API
  participant DB as Database

  Note over Tech,App: Onsite at the customer
  Tech->>App: Reveal password
  activate App
  App->>+API: POST /passwords/:id/reveal
  API->>DB: SELECT secret
  DB-->>API: ciphertext
  API-->>-App: plaintext (in memory only)
  deactivate App

  loop every 30s
    App->>API: heartbeat
  end

  alt session expired
    API-->>App: 401
    App->>Tech: route to login
  else still valid
    API-->>App: 200
  end

  par audit
    API->>DB: INSERT audit_log
  and metrics
    API->>API: increment counter
  end

  Note right of DB: Never persisted to disk
  rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
    Tech->>App: background the app
    App->>App: clear revealed secret
  end
